hen first published and revised in the following year's release; the series uses the revised year-ago values where available. Totals are domestic plus international and exclude general aviation."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","note":"Taken from AAI's monthly 'Traffic News Summary' (all operational Indian airports). Each month's figure is the provisional number from its own release, replaced by the revised year-ago figure printed in the following year's release once available; the latest 12 months are therefore provisional. A few months may be missing where AAI's summary could not be read.","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:31:12+00:00"}